'''TALON''' (formerly stylized as '''Talon Esports''') is a [[:Category:Hong Kong|Hong Kong]] based esports organization founded in 2017.

On November 18<sup>th</sup>, 2025 [[Riot Games]] announced that TALON had been removed from the VCT Pacific International League, citing a "failure to operate and manage its team in accordance with league standards, including a pattern of significantly overdue payments to players and an inability to demonstrate sufficient financial capacity to continue participating in the VCT.".<ref name="TALON kicked">{{cite web|url=https://valorantesports.com/en-SG/news/riot-games-terminates-talon-esports-vct-pacific-partnership|title=Riot Games Terminates TALON Esports' VCT Pacific Partnership|author=[[VALORANT Champions Tour]]|date=2025-11-18}}</ref>
